note_id":"n-c480ade0f0913bd6d1da","start":383,"end":396,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-7afd12882015e084317a","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-58fb185861c2591b0764","layer":"original","quote":"二月，镇军陆抗、抚军步协、征西将军留平，建平太守盛曼〖2〗，率众围蜀巴东守将罗宪","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o048a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-214613f5a625f33a352f","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，荆州刺史王基、新城太守（陈）〔州〕泰攻吴〖2〗。破之，降者数千口。二月，置南郡之夷陵县以居降附〖3〗。三月，以尚书令司马孚为司空〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xuhuwang-q-4eae72fe193408cf4256","section":"chapter-027","block":"b-740080942f6b034a42cd","layer":"original","quote":"随征南王昶击吴〖10〗；基别袭步协于夷陵〖11〗。协闭门自守。基示以攻形，而实分兵取雄父邸阁〖12〗，收米三十余万斛；虏安北将军谭正，纳降数千口。","section_title":"徐胡二王传第二十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0060.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-4acf253b0fadb603e733","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-6eacaf4bfffaf4f6febd","layer":"original","quote":"子协嗣，统骘所领，加抚军将军。协卒，子玑嗣侯。协弟阐，继业为西陵督；加昭武将军〖4〗，封西亭侯","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-7b376d7e2c916b9995fc","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-dc938f3589852f99c02f","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛瑾子融，步骘子协，虽各袭任，